# GitHub CLI Integration Guide

## What is gh (GitHub CLI)?

`gh` is the official GitHub Command Line Interface. It lets you interact with GitHub directly from your terminal without opening a browser. This is especially useful when working with Claude Code for automated workflows.

### Installation

```bash
# macOS
brew install gh

# Linux/WSL
sudo apt-get install gh

# Or visit https://cli.github.com
```

### Authentication

```bash
gh auth login
# Follow prompts to authenticate
# Credentials are stored locally for future use
```

