## Core GitHub Operations

### Pull Requests

```bash
# Create a new PR
gh pr create --title "Your title" --body "Description"

# Create PR with multiple options
gh pr create --title "Fix: Bug in login" \
  --body "Fixes #123. Changes include..." \
  --reviewer @username \
  --assignee @username \
  --base main

# List all open PRs
gh pr list

# View specific PR details
gh pr view 123

# Check PR status (your PRs)
gh pr status

# Review a PR
gh pr review 123 --approve
gh pr review 123 --request-changes
gh pr review 123 --comment -b "Looks good!"

# Merge a PR
gh pr merge 123                    # Interactive
gh pr merge 123 --merge            # Squash commits
gh pr merge 123 --squash           # Squash commits
gh pr merge 123 --rebase           # Rebase commits
gh pr merge 123 --delete-branch    # Delete branch after merge

# Check out a PR locally
gh pr checkout 123
```

### Issues

```bash
# Create an issue
gh issue create --title "Bug: Login broken"
gh issue create --title "Feature request" --body "Description" --label "enhancement"

# List issues
gh issue list
gh issue list --state open
gh issue list --label bug

# View issue details
gh issue view 123

# Close an issue
gh issue close 123

# Reopen an issue
gh issue reopen 123
```

### Repositories

```bash
# View repository info
gh repo view

# List your repos
gh repo list

# Clone a repo
gh repo clone username/repo-name

# Create a new repo
gh repo create my-repo --public
gh repo create my-repo --private --source=. --remote=origin --push
```

### Branches

```bash
# Check out a branch
gh repo clone username/repo && gh co branch-name

# List branches
git branch -a

# Delete a remote branch
git push origin --delete branch-name
```

