## Advanced gh Commands

### API Access
```bash
# Use gh api for advanced queries
gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/issues
gh api search/issues --input - << 'EOF'
{"query": "is:open repo:owner/repo"}
EOF
```

### Watch Repository Activity
```bash
# Get notifications
gh notification list

# View activity
gh run list
gh run view <run-id>
```

### Complex PR Operations
```bash
# Merge only if checks pass
gh pr merge 123 --auto --squash

# Merge with custom commit message
gh pr merge 123 --squash --body "Custom message"

# Draft PR (ready for feedback)
gh pr create --draft --title "WIP: Feature"
```

